[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Make sure that the ignition is OFF, then\nloosen the bolt and disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584378\">1092C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584920\">5530A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Disconnect the electrical connections from\nthe starter motor and move them aside.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Loosen the band and disconnect the engine oil recovery pipe,\nengine oil recovery manifold side.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the engine oil recovery manifold\n(2b) complete with gaskets (2c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065837.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit in its seating the engine oil recovery\nmanifold complete with gaskets and secure it with the bolts.</p><p>Connect the engine oil recovery pipe, engine\noil recovery manifold side, and tighten the band.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nstarter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584920\">5530A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584378\">1092C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]